                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 42-year-old male patient, admitted on 09/11/2025 with an acute exacerbation of known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, the patient presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Clinical examination, chest X-ray, arterial blood gas analysis, and spirometry confirmed an acute COPD exacerbation without evidence of pneumonia or cardiac decompensation. Blood tests showed mild inflammatory markers. The patient was treated successfully with nebulised bronchodilators, systemic corticosteroids, and supplemental oxygen therapy. Vital signs were monitored continuously. Pulse oximetry showed satisfactory recovery. The patient received inhaler technique education and was counselled regarding smoking cessation and adherence to maintenance therapy. He was discharged in stable condition on 10/11/2025. Please arrange outpatient pulmonology follow-up and consider pulmonary rehabilitation referral. Yours sincerely, Dr. [Treating Physician].</div>
               </text>
            </section>
